<title>UK: Vodafone volume up as stake placed - traders.</title>
<headline>Vodafone volume up as stake placed - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading volume in Vodafone Plc leapt as BZW placed a line of stock in the mobile phone group at 218p, traders said.</p>
<p>The stock was unchanged at 222p by 1050 GMT in volume of 22.4 million shares.  </p>
<p>No-one at BZW was immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
